(7216499, 1112375, 76811, '<td valign="top">I am torn on this one. Love the message truly I want peace, but I also love AR''s and I hate anything construed as anti gun. Still artistically well done regardless of the politics</td>', 'I am torn on this one. Love the message truly I want peace, but I also love AR''s and I hate anything construed as anti gun. Still artistically well done regardless of the politics', '2014-05-14 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216500, 1112622, 76811, '<td valign="top">points for eliciting a chuckle</td>', 'points for eliciting a chuckle', '2014-05-14 11:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216502, 1112591, 76811, '<td valign="top">nice shot, wrong challenge?</td>', 'nice shot, wrong challenge?', '2014-05-14 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216504, 1112627, 76811, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the finger on the trigger, even though these are just pictures, gun safety should always be practiced. The hammer is down with a flexed finger on the trigger for all I know the gun was just discharged. The message implied about Americans and guns, and the grunge effect accentuates that image. Overall I dislike it immensely, that doesn''t mean however it isn''t art, it certainly expresses your feelings very well, and all the pieces play together to get the message across... I hate the context, but well done anyway</td>', 'Don''t like the finger on the trigger, even though these are just pictures, gun safety should always be practiced. The hammer is down with a flexed finger on the trigger for all I know the gun was just discharged. The message implied about Americans and guns, and the grunge effect accentuates that image. Overall I dislike it immensely, that doesn''t mean however it isn''t art, it certainly expresses your feelings very well, and all the pieces play together to get the message across... I hate the context, but well done anyway', '2014-05-14 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216505, 1112415, 76811, '<td valign="top">Haha! That is a very bad day for someone, but cool image!</td>', 'Haha! That is a very bad day for someone, but cool image!', '2014-05-14 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216506, 1112429, 76811, '<td valign="top">very tasteful nice capture</td>', 'very tasteful nice capture', '2014-05-14 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216508, 1112570, 76811, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2014-05-14 11:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216509, 1112414, 76811, '<td valign="top">safely stored, but the color and noise throw me off, seems like a glare through glass of a gun cabinet</td>', 'safely stored, but the color and noise throw me off, seems like a glare through glass of a gun cabinet', '2014-05-14 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216510, 1112574, 76811, '<td valign="top">points for a chuckle and the image is well composed.</td>', 'points for a chuckle and the image is well composed.', '2014-05-14 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216516, 1112582, 76811, '<td valign="top">as in other images I commented on, I may not agree with the statement of the image, but still it is artistic and well composed. I would have preferred and angled barrel with the flower off to one side or the other still focused the way you have it with a shallow DOF but again that is a preference. Nice work.</td>', 'as in other images I commented on, I may not agree with the statement of the image, but still it is artistic and well composed. I would have preferred and angled barrel with the flower off to one side or the other still focused the way you have it with a shallow DOF but again that is a preference. Nice work.', '2014-05-14 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216517, 1112520, 76811, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good color, good choice of firearm and good down range safety. Love it.</td>', 'Very nice. Good color, good choice of firearm and good down range safety. Love it.', '2014-05-14 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216518, 1112382, 76811, '<td valign="top">made me smile.</td>', 'made me smile.', '2014-05-14 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216519, 1112501, 76811, '<td valign="top">Love this image as a hunter and as an artist. Well done.</td>', 'Love this image as a hunter and as an artist. Well done.', '2014-05-14 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216520, 1112450, 76811, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great leading lines, great perspective, great colors</td>', 'Nicely done. Great leading lines, great perspective, great colors', '2014-05-14 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216521, 1112550, 76811, '<td valign="top">points for the humor and the time period of it.</td>', 'points for the humor and the time period of it.', '2014-05-14 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216522, 1112367, 76811, '<td valign="top">artistically well done. Politically sends me on a rant about the current police state, but lets just stick with well done</td>', 'artistically well done. Politically sends me on a rant about the current police state, but lets just stick with well done', '2014-05-14 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216523, 1112355, 76811, '<td valign="top">alright, not sure how you pulled it off so well but you did. Great job</td>', 'alright, not sure how you pulled it off so well but you did. Great job', '2014-05-14 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216526, 1112620, 76811, '<td valign="top">Sorry to be a downer but I don''t like anything about the image, thumb on the hammer, finger on the trigger and finger in the barrel? this is a safety nightmare and promoted poor gun safety. Not my style obviously but looking objectively at it from a photo standpoint I still can''t find much love for it.</td>', 'Sorry to be a downer but I don''t like anything about the image, thumb on the hammer, finger on the trigger and finger in the barrel? this is a safety nightmare and promoted poor gun safety. Not my style obviously but looking objectively at it from a photo standpoint I still can''t find much love for it.', '2014-05-14 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216528, 1112562, 76811, '<td valign="top">nice take on the challenge, nice lighting and effects though my staple gun sadly doesn''t make cool smokescreens!</td>', 'nice take on the challenge, nice lighting and effects though my staple gun sadly doesn''t make cool smokescreens!', '2014-05-14 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216529, 1112215, 76811, '<td valign="top">Though I like the concept, I don''t like the direction of the muzzle or projectiles. With blurred casings we should also have had blurred slide and the projectiles could never have been that close moving at 900 feet per second, but again great concept and executed pretty well.</td>', 'Though I like the concept, I don''t like the direction of the muzzle or projectiles. With blurred casings we should also have had blurred slide and the projectiles could never have been that close moving at 900 feet per second, but again great concept and executed pretty well.', '2014-05-14 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216530, 1112315, 76811, '<td valign="top">Although I disagree with the title, from a standpoint of photo art it is fantastic. well done</td>', 'Although I disagree with the title, from a standpoint of photo art it is fantastic. well done', '2014-05-14 12:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216531, 1112526, 76811, '<td valign="top">would have loved this image with a Kimber, ed brown, les baer etc. but this turned out great. Great light, great effect</td>', 'would have loved this image with a Kimber, ed brown, les baer etc. but this turned out great. Great light, great effect', '2014-05-14 12:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216532, 1112595, 76811, '<td valign="top">hate the hammer coming back and finger on the trigger since I want to promote gun safety, but the image is very well composed, lit and creative. Nice capture</td>', 'hate the hammer coming back and finger on the trigger since I want to promote gun safety, but the image is very well composed, lit and creative. Nice capture', '2014-05-14 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216534, 1112148, 76811, '<td valign="top">interesting piece, well lit and composed</td>', 'interesting piece, well lit and composed', '2014-05-14 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216535, 1112486, 30861, '<td valign="top">Geeze... Couldn''t you have MOVED a little? That light standard''s gotta be bleeding points away from you :-( Nice work otherwise.</td>', 'Geeze... Couldn''t you have MOVED a little? That light standard''s gotta be bleeding points away from you :-( Nice work otherwise.', '2014-05-14 12:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216536, 1112576, 76811, '<td valign="top">I like the title and how it relates to the image, I have ranted about muzzles pointed at cameras all through the challenge, but seeing the cylinder clearly open and empty I give this one a pass. Great choice in the revolver as well, great DOF and lit very nicely. I like this.</td>', 'I like the title and how it relates to the image, I have ranted about muzzles pointed at cameras all through the challenge, but seeing the cylinder clearly open and empty I give this one a pass. Great choice in the revolver as well, great DOF and lit very nicely. I like this.', '2014-05-14 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216537, 1112523, 76811, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up well executed</td>', 'Very nice set up well executed', '2014-05-14 12:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216538, 1112589, 76811, '<td valign="top">great firearm, nice setup, good capture</td>', 'great firearm, nice setup, good capture', '2014-05-14 12:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216540, 1112065, 76811, '<td valign="top">As mentioned in all the other images, I hate muzzle shots as they do not promote gun safety. Seeing this is not chambered helps and the lighting is well done. Regardless of me not liking the muzzle the photo is well done.</td>', 'As mentioned in all the other images, I hate muzzle shots as they do not promote gun safety. Seeing this is not chambered helps and the lighting is well done. Regardless of me not liking the muzzle the photo is well done.', '2014-05-14 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216542, 1112626, 76811, '<td valign="top">love this shot. The sepia with the distressed holster and revolver are awesome. Would like the other revolver and holster equally distressed creating a more authentic time piece and would have liked a gun belt with ammor loops and cartridges, but still great shot well done</td>', 'love this shot. The sepia with the distressed holster and revolver are awesome. Would like the other revolver and holster equally distressed creating a more authentic time piece and would have liked a gun belt with ammor loops and cartridges, but still great shot well done', '2014-05-14 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216544, 1112446, 76811, '<td valign="top">Okay last rant for the day. I can''t agree at all with the composure of the image, but for what you were going for it was well done. I can''t fault that just the concept.</td>', 'Okay last rant for the day. I can''t agree at all with the composure of the image, but for what you were going for it was well done. I can''t fault that just the concept.', '2014-05-14 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216545, 1112515, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, Wendy... I never had a chance, did I? How you scoring? This is gorgeous.</td>', 'Sheesh, Wendy... I never had a chance, did I? How you scoring? This is gorgeous.', '2014-05-14 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
