(7216713, 1112573, 174999, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this, you had the title named right for sure. I would love to see more details of this riffle though. The handles and butt is really cool. I feel I am missing out on the history of this beautiful gun with it being too dark.  Looks like there is an awesome sight on that gun too which I like. I think you do have the background right and it fits the look of that gun which is a nice feel for this picture. I wish I could have seen just a hint of more lighting/highlighting on that top part of  that gun. I did not ding you for the darkness.</td>', 'When I first saw this, you had the title named right for sure. I would love to see more details of this riffle though. The handles and butt is really cool. I feel I am missing out on the history of this beautiful gun with it being too dark.  Looks like there is an awesome sight on that gun too which I like. I think you do have the background right and it fits the look of that gun which is a nice feel for this picture. I wish I could have seen just a hint of more lighting/highlighting on that top part of  that gun. I did not ding you for the darkness.', '2014-05-14 18:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
