(7216921, 1112415, 174999, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept of what you did and composition of things.<br/>I did not rate this high or low...<br/> <br/>I am not sure though about the background and lighting. I do like what you had the items in. For my it blinds my eyes and it really forces me to see through the items Too bright. I think I would have liked to see a softer darker touch, warming things up a bit bringing out the details of the items and especially the gun. Right now to me it looks just like a shadow.</td>', 'I really like this concept of what you did and composition of things.I did not rate this high or low... I am not sure though about the background and lighting. I do like what you had the items in. For my it blinds my eyes and it really forces me to see through the items Too bright. I think I would have liked to see a softer darker touch, warming things up a bit bringing out the details of the items and especially the gun. Right now to me it looks just like a shadow.', '2014-05-15 08:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216923, 1112446, 174999, '<td valign="top">I like how this  is focused on the barrel and not the person. A good technique I am still trying to learn myself.<br/> <br/>I am not sure about having the sight being blurred with the barrel and that distracts me a bit. More powerful if both of those things were together focused since it was a head on shot</td>', 'I like how this  is focused on the barrel and not the person. A good technique I am still trying to learn myself. I am not sure about having the sight being blurred with the barrel and that distracts me a bit. More powerful if both of those things were together focused since it was a head on shot', '2014-05-15 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
