(7218978, 1112576, 117534, '<td valign="top">OH OH Bear has a gun&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; running&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;   Seriously Congrats on the TT, an EXCELLENT piece of work!</td>', 'OH OH Bear has a gun>>>>>> running>>>>>>>   Seriously Congrats on the TT, an EXCELLENT piece of work!', '2014-05-21 02:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
