(7218988, 1112515, 117474, '<td valign="top">Excellent Wendy. Well deserved 7 and blue! Love the natural feel. Love it! (I should have said that my nitpick hardly affected my vote at all; the scene spoke for itself here!)</td>', 'Excellent Wendy. Well deserved 7 and blue! Love the natural feel. Love it! (I should have said that my nitpick hardly affected my vote at all; the scene spoke for itself here!)', '2014-05-21 03:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
