(7219165, 1112412, 11854, '<td valign="top">I recently read a news story where a guy came out of his house yelling at some city workers for making a racket. The workers called the cops stating the guy was threatening them with a gun. Turns out the gun was a tattoo of a gun made to look like it was stuck in his waistband. ROFL! Your comments made me think of it.<br/></td>', 'I recently read a news story where a guy came out of his house yelling at some city workers for making a racket. The workers called the cops stating the guy was threatening them with a gun. Turns out the gun was a tattoo of a gun made to look like it was stuck in his waistband. ROFL! Your comments made me think of it.', '2014-05-21 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7219171, 1112595, 12611, '<td valign="top">excellent work. you do "the land of Spaghetti Westerns" proud!</td>', 'excellent work. you do "the land of Spaghetti Westerns" proud!', '2014-05-21 11:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
