(7219222, 1112595, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GrillTowel:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice. <br/> <br/>I wonder how people killed each other before guns were invented? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There are (and there were) many ways to kill a man - guns make it easier.</td>', 'Originally posted by GrillTowel: Nice.  I wonder how people killed each other before guns were invented?   There are (and there were) many ways to kill a man - guns make it easier.', '2014-05-21 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7219226, 1112515, 19825, '<td valign="top">You are so good at capturing interesting scene Williamsburg and Jamestown. The light and processing are fantastic -- I love the warm glow of the skin tones. Nice job.</td>', 'You are so good at capturing interesting scene Williamsburg and Jamestown. The light and processing are fantastic -- I love the warm glow of the skin tones. Nice job.', '2014-05-21 12:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
