(7219253, 1112515, 144271, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot.  The lighting, the subject, all of it.  You are so lucky to have such great historic places to shoot at.  Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'I just love this shot.  The lighting, the subject, all of it.  You are so lucky to have such great historic places to shoot at.  Congrats on the blue.', '2014-05-21 13:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
