(7219914, 1112450, 55822, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite from this challenge, not just cause it''s a great shot but I served on her sister ship the Iowa. I can remember sitting under turret 1 looking out over the bow with a view similar to this. Thank you for the flashback.</td>', 'This was one of my favorite from this challenge, not just cause it''s a great shot but I served on her sister ship the Iowa. I can remember sitting under turret 1 looking out over the bow with a view similar to this. Thank you for the flashback.', '2014-05-23 08:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
